---
title: Copilot evaluation basics
summary: A minimum viable evaluation kit for enterprise GenAI copilots before broad rollout.
publishedAt: 2026-05-18
author: KaleidoSpark
---

A copilot that “feels good” in a demo is not ready for regulated workflows.

## Define the task and the bar

Write the job-to-be-done, the acceptable error rate, and the escalation path when the model is unsure. Then build a fixed eval set that product and risk agree on.

## Measure retrieval and generation separately

Many failures are retrieval failures. If you only score final answers, you will optimise the wrong layer.
